{"id":4097,"title":{"romaji":"Jidou Hanbaiki ni Umarekawatta Ore wa Meikyuu wo Samayou","english":"Reborn as a Vending Machine, I Now Wander the Dungeon","native":"自動販売機に生まれ変わった俺は迷宮を彷徨う"},"slug":"jidou_hanbaiki_ni_umarekawatta_ore_wa_meikyuu_wo_samayou","synopsis":"After dying in a traffic accident, I find myself standing near an unfamiliar lake. My body won't move, I can't hear my voice, and when I try to shout in confusion, words that I never expected come out! \"Get one free with a winner.\" I-it seems I've turned into a vending machine...! I can only do what actual vending machines can. It's impossible to move by myself, and there's no way for me to have any meaningful conversation-how am I going to survive some fantasy world's dungeon like this?!","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2023,"createdAt":"2023-07-04 06:10:38","updatedAt":"2024-03-22 21:11:18","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":52619},{"site":"ANN","externalId":26186},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":153360},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17557},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":21270},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46311},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":11247,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/z7qu8fSPsodgj5DIQdVepSGArR8d35CodwcNcmVQ.jpg"},{"id":11248,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/Pu7g25eLx8qxeoYJEbz6GFLklXWj5nnm30xd4mX3.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":16,"name":"Studio Gokumi","slug":"studio_gokumi"},{"id":247,"name":"AXsiZ","slug":"axsiz"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":636,"name":"Jidou Hanbaiki ni Umarekawatta Ore wa Meikyuu wo Samayou","slug":"jidou_hanbaiki_ni_umarekawatta_ore_wa_meikyuu_wo_samayou"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":12407,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12372,"title":{"romaji":"Fanfare","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":14508,"version":1,"episodes":"2-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"i